(c4) <sp>V/</sp>. 1. Ex(d)súr(e)gat(fe/fih) De(hhh/f!gwhGFE/f)us(fe;) et(d!ewfe) dis(fd)si(e!fhg)pén(hhh/f!gwhg)tur(h;) in(h)i(hih)mí(hhh)ci(fih) e(hhh/jvIH/hvGF)jus:(fhf/fe) (:) et(de) fú(e/hh)gi(h)ant,(hh//hhh/jvIH/hvGF/E/f;) qui(e!fwhf) o(h)dé(hfh/hhh)runt(f!gwh) e(hiHG)um(g;) a(fh) fá(hhh/jvIH/hvGF)ci(fgFE)e(e/hh/he) e(hhh/hf)jus.(efED;fhg/hhf/de) (::) * Benedíctus.() (::)
<sp>V/</sp>. 2. Pér(fh!iji)e(i)ant(i) pec(i)ca(i)tó(ij)res(jij;) a(hi) fá(jlj/ji)ci(i)e(i) De(ijIH)i:(hhh/fgf:) ju(fh/hhh/jki/jvHF)sti,(fhf/fe;) qui(fh) e(fh/hhh/ihi)pu(fh)lén(hhh/jvIH/hvGF)tur,(fhf/fe;) ex(de)súl(e/hh)tent,(hh//hhh/jvIH/hvG/E/f;) in(e!gwhf) con(h)spé(hfh/hhh)ctu(f!gwhG/E) De(hiHG)i,(g:) de(fh)lec(h)tén(hhh/jvIH/hvGF)tur(fhf/fe,) in(fe/ed) læ(ef)tí(fh/hhh/hih)ti(hh/hf)a.(efED/fhg/hhf/de) (::)
